P.append(page("categories","STARTUP SHOWCASE (CONTINUED)",f'''<div class="num">{h("<span class='o'>02.1</span> List of Categories for Startup")}</div>{cg}
<div class="box"><h3 class="h sm">Bharat Connect Startup Showcase</h3><p class="it">(in alignment with Startup India, DPIIT vision)</p><i class="bar"></i><ul class="sq two"><li><b>Simplifying the path to global markets</b> — the Showcase gives startup founders a curated stage in front of investors and industry leaders, complementing Startup India DPIIT’s work to ease regulation, fast-track patents and simplify compliance for startups back at home.</li><li><b>Building capital and funding access</b> — by bringing mentors, incubators and investors into direct conversation with founders. The day echoes Startup India, DPIIT's own funding pathways, such as the Startup India, DPIIT Seed Fund Scheme (SISFS) and the Fund of Funds for Startups (FoF).</li><li><b>Opening market access</b> — the day opens international market and investor access for founders, mirroring Startup India, DPIIT's efforts to open public procurement (via GeM) and global trade routes to Indian startups.</li><li><b>Grassroots &amp; inclusive outreach</b> — in the spirit of Startup India, DPIIT's push to extend entrepreneurial infrastructure beyond metro cities into Tier 2, Tier 3 and rural India, the Showcase welcomes founders from across India's startup landscape onto one global stage.</li></ul></div>
<p class="tagl">BUSINESS · STARTUPS · INNOVATIONS · FUTURE</p>''',FT1,"05",True))
# 6 why
P.append(page("why","FOR FOUNDERS",f'''<div class="nvb nm"><h3 class="h">Participation Rationality for Startup Founders</h3><i class="bar"></i><ul class="sq two"><li><b>Strategic Matchmaking</b> — curated introductions to UK and European investors, buyers and business leaders relevant to your business.</li><li><b>Market Validation &amp; Localisation Feedback</b> — honest, real-world feedback on product-market fit outside India, plus insight into pricing, packaging and market norms abroad.</li><li><b>Media Visibility &amp; Brand Credibility</b> — professional photography and video of your pitch, and the chance to earn credibility-building testimonials for your website and pitch decks.</li><li><b>Cross-Border Benchmarking</b> — a clear read on where your startup stands globally, learning directly from international peers and judges.</li><li><b>A Funding Conversation</b> — a genuine opportunity to move from pitch to partnership, not just a demo slot.</li></ul></div>
<div class="num">{h("<span class='o'>02.2</span> Why Participate — What You'll Take Home")}</div><p class="lead">Bharat Mahotsav London 2027 isn't just a stage — it's where India's next generation of founders step onto the world's radar.</p>
<ul class="sq two"><li><b>Global Visibility</b> — Put your brand in front of an international audience of investors, media and industry leaders, on a London stage.</li><li><b>Direct Investor Access</b> — Real, curated conversations with global investors - not a demo slot, a genuine shot at your next funding round.</li><li><b>Certification at Premium Educational Institute (Oxford/LSE)</b> — A full day of leadership and marketing panel discussions at a prestigious London University, capped with a certificate that belongs on your pitch deck.</li><li><b>Strategic Networking</b> — Share the platform with policymakers, industry leaders, mentors, incubators and fellow founders who've already built what you're building.</li><li><b>Cultural Positioning</b> — Align your brand with India's growth story, on a platform built around innovation, heritage and ambition.</li><li><b>B2B &amp; B2G Opportunities</b> — Build partnerships across public and private sectors that outlast the event itself.</li><li><b>Brand Association</b> — Be part of a defining India-on-the-world-stage moment, not just another expo booth.</li><li><b>Media &amp; Press Coverage</b> — Professional photography, video coverage and press mentions across Indian and international outlets - pitch-ready assets for your website and next raise.</li><li><b>Landmark Brand Association</b> — Be part of a defining India-on-the-world-stage moment, not just another expo booth.</li><li><b>Long-Term Relationships</b> — Long-term connections with investors, mentors and fellow founders that keep working for you long after Feb 2027.</li></ul>''',FT1,"06"))
# 7 partners
P.append(page("partners","PARTNERS",f'''<div class="num">{h("<span class='o'>03</span> Take Away for Sponsors")}</div><p class="lead">Put your brand at the centre of the conversation.</p>
<ul class="sq two"><li><b>Positioning of Brand</b> — Prime visibility across venues, print and digital assets.</li><li><b>Stage &amp; Session Branding</b> — Association with keynote and marquee sessions.</li><li><b>VIP Access</b> — Curated networking with dignitaries and business leaders.</li><li><b>Content &amp; Media Amplification</b> — Reach across press, digital and social platforms.</li><li><b>Delegate &amp; Investor Access</b> — Direct engagement with a targeted global audience.</li><li><b>Legacy Association</b> — Long-term brand recall tied to a landmark India platform.</li></ul>{im("p07_00","Sponsors","strip")}
<div class="num">{h("<span class='o'>04</span> Take Away for Stakeholders &amp; Associates")}</div><p class="lead">Stakeholders &amp; Associates carry more than an experience — with tangible outcomes that continue well beyond the event.</p>
<ul class="sq two"><li><b>New Business Leads</b> — Qualified connections across sectors &amp; geographies.</li><li><b>Investment Conversations</b> — Direct access to investors and decision-makers.</li><li><b>Cultural Exposure</b> — A platform to showcase heritage, craft &amp; creativity.</li><li><b>Media Visibility</b> — Coverage across international press and platforms.</li><li><b>Strategic Partnerships</b> — Collaborations that extend beyond London 2027.</li><li><b>Policy &amp; Trade Insight</b> — Perspective from government &amp; industry.</li><li><b>Global Network</b> — Relationships across business, startups and culture.</li><li><b>A Seat At The Table</b> — Recognition as part of India's growth story.</li></ul>{im("p07_01","Stakeholders","strip")}''',FT1,"07",True))
